{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>ADRENALINE: May The Sun Return is a first-person parkour game where you try to escape a proceduraly generated futuristic district. Master your reflexes as you make your way through this hermetically sealed city.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">No one helps you find your way out. It is only up to you to make an escape. You will have to rely on your intuition and skill to make it out alive. Improvisation and quick decision-making are the way forward.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585380/extras/GIF_5.gif?t=1750350304\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As you turn for riskier parkour and extreme heights, your adrenaline level rises granting you supernatural abilities and unlocking even more possibilities to advance through the night.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585380/extras/GIF_6.gif?t=1750350304\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every district is different. There is no right or wrong path. You decide how to escape from a city filled to the brim with police, surveillance drones and barricades. Will you be able to maneuver yourself out of trouble, or will you fall into the hands of those in your way?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">This game offers:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Parkour</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Procedural levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">ADRENALINE abilities</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">This game does not offer:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A story</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Reasonable combat or exploration</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3585380?t=1750350304","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585380/603b35e3c636d5c512d9f302fa4c299d77dcf1a2/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1750350304","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585380/d0b07ff23157c2d930731da2a00bb02da17f45cb/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1750350304","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585380/d0b07ff23157c2d930731da2a00bb02da17f45cb/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1750350304","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"Violence"},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>ADRENALINE: May The Sun Return is a first-person parkour game where you try to escape a proceduraly generated futuristic district. Master your reflexes as you make your way through this hermetically sealed city.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">No one helps you find your way out. It is only up to you to make an escape. You will have to rely on your intuition and skill to make it out alive. Improvisation and quick decision-making are the way forward.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585380/extras/GIF_5.gif?t=1750350304\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As you turn for riskier parkour and extreme heights, your adrenaline level rises granting you supernatural abilities and unlocking even more possibilities to advance through the night.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585380/extras/GIF_6.gif?t=1750350304\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every district is different. There is no right or wrong path. You decide how to escape from a city filled to the brim with police, surveillance drones and barricades. Will you be able to maneuver yourself out of trouble, or will you fall into the hands of those in your way?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">This game offers:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Parkour</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Procedural levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">ADRENALINE abilities</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">This game does not offer:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A story</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Reasonable combat or exploration</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","developers":["Softwareentwicklung Philipp Haase"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Racing","id":"9"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585380/ce87abd97735b799006177481f421b8ac58e11bf/header.jpg?t=1750350304","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> 12<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Intel Iris Pro Graphcs 6200<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 300 MB available space</li></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257119663,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257119663/movie480.mp4?t=1750334039","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257119663/movie_max.mp4?t=1750334039"},"name":"Nighttime","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257119663/888b7162ea64533a82d787011c0f499a9bded385/movie_600x337.jpg?t=17503